---

<section class="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">🗺️</span>
        <h3>Plan before you book</h3>
        <p>
          Add destinations, explore activities, and estimate costs before
          committing to anything.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">👥</span>
        <h3>Built for groups</h3>
        <p>
          Track members, split expenses, and keep everyone on the same page.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">✈️</span>
        <h3>From planning to takeoff</h3>
        <p>
          Confirm your trip when you're ready and your plan becomes your
          itinerary.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
</style>
